ough the Valve Signature of Turbid Water Night.","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-04.json","anchor":"person-ryu-dain-list2"}]}],"detailRoute":"/people/person-0112","affiliation":{"kind":"state","stateId":"arc","name":"Arc"}},{"id":"K140","personId":"K140","kind":"person","name":"Ryu Ga-on","birthDate":"2079-08-10","deathDate":null,"status":"preserved","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/name-pools/cast-birthdays.json","anchor":"K140"},{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-05.json","anchor":"Person-Ryu-Gaon-list2"}],"timeline":[{"year":2126,"summary":"Generation of 2126. Grew up on the Sinnae transfer duty shift. The post of Protectorate Force Dispatch Escort Officer opened after stopping an unticketed departing train.","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-05.json","anchor":"Person-Ryu-Gaon-list2"}]}],"detailRoute":"/people/person-0141","affiliation":{"kind":"state","stateId":"arc","name":"Arc"}},{"id":"K244","personId":"K244","kind":"person","name":"Ryu Haedam","birthDate":"2065-09-15","deathDate":null,"status":"preserved","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/name-pools/cast-birthdays.json","anchor":"K244"},{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-09.json","anchor":"person-ryu-hae-dam-list2"}],"timeline":[{"year":2126,"summary":"Generation of 2126. Raised on the waiting hall watch. The post of market price rumor verification writer opened through covering a shift left empty by an unauthorized absence.","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-09.json","anchor":"person-ryu-hae-dam-list2"}]}],"detailRoute":"/people/person-0245","affiliation":{"kind":"state","stateId":"free-city","name":"Free City"}},{"id":"K322","personId":"K322","kind":"person","name":"Ryu Eunbi","birthDate":"2070-09-16","deathDate":null,"status":"preserved","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/name-pools/cast-birthdays.json","anchor":"K322"},{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-13.json","anchor":"inmul-ryueunbi-p1"}],"timeline":[{"year":2126,"summary":"Generation of 2126. Treatment around the Jegi-dong herbal medicine market (Gyeongdong). Her hands are medicine. The Jegi-dong herbal ledger and hospital duty left behind a treatment oath that does not distinguish friend from foe. The commander supervises specialists'' clinical judgment and confirms the succession of trainees designated by specialists. Ryu Eunbi became commander after keeping the bed roster of the Cheongnyangni Medical House unbroken. The roster of the Jegidong Healing Gate belongs to Jeong Harin. Dongdaemun night wages are the western household of this realm. If counterfeit medicine circulates, she cuts off trade. She weighs severity and clinical findings together. If Nam Yungyeong''s market price pre-purchases the medicine, the beds will stand empty.","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-13.json","anchor":"inmul-ryueunbi-p1"}]}],"detailRoute":"/people/person-0323","affiliation":{"kind":"state","stateId":"government","name":"The Government"}},{"id":"K441","personId":"K441","kind":"person","name":"Ryu Donghyeon","birthDate":"2083-12-17","deathDate":null,"status":"preserved","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/name-pools/cast-birthdays.json","anchor":"K441"},{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-02.json","anchor":"person-ryu-donghyeon-list2"}],"timeline":[{"year":2126,"summary":"Generation of 2126. He grew up at the Amsa guard post. The Power Device Patrol post opened through the catching of an illicit night river crossing.","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-02.json","anchor":"person-ryu-donghyeon-list2"}]}],"detailRoute":"/people/person-0441","affiliation":{"kind":"state","stateId":"geography:duchy:11590","name":"Dongjak-gu"}},{"id":"K797","personId":"K797","kind":"person","name":"Ryu Dalhyeon","birthDate":"2095-11-29","deathDate":null,"status":"preserved","sourceRefs":[{"path":"lore/name-pools/cast-birthdays.json","anchor":"K797"},{"path":"lore/characters/Cast-State-06.json","anchor":"Person-Ryu-Dalhyeon-list2"}],"timeline":[{"year":2126,"summary":"Born in the 2126 genera